Package: bwTools
Type: Package
Title: Native R Tools for BigWig, WIG, and bedGraph Files
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides native R implementations for reading local bigWig files and
    reading WIG and bedGraph signal tracks. BigWig binary parsing uses base R
    random-access binary I/O and zlib decompression without bundled C or C++
    code or external UCSC executables. Signal objects follow the BwgTrack data
    contract used by GeneTrackR for direct downstream interoperability.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: data.table
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
NeedsCompilation: no
